1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:07,920
This is eZstudy. It turns any handout into a study space that grades you, quizzes you, and helps you review.

2
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:16,508
There's plenty of study material, but once a test is graded, it gets filed away. Mistakes are never collected, so they repeat.

3
00:00:17,008 --> 00:00:24,472
eZstudy's idea is simple: one Markdown file is your notes, your test, your mistake log, and your AI tutor's material.

4
00:00:24,972 --> 00:00:30,516
Read, mark, write, check, fix, and practice, all in one document.

5
00:00:31,016 --> 00:00:35,360
If you can type, you can write a test. Answers are graded instantly.

6
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:41,260
The AI tutor works on the scope and skill you pick, then saves the results back into your notes.

7
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:46,272
Teachers publish study folders, and students import them in one click.

8
00:00:46,772 --> 00:00:52,316
Your data stays yours. Export to PDF or Word, and practice on your phone.

9
00:00:52,816 --> 00:00:59,152
Our vision: every student gets an AI tutor that knows their own material. Try eZstudy today!

